<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/41/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 2 comes into operation on the same date the Criminal Procedure Code (Amendment) Act 2010 [Act A1378] comes into operation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/41/eng@> .
