<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/41/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 3 shall not apply in relation to criminal proceedings which began before the commencement of that section. New section 73aa"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/41/eng@> .
