<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/41/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The testimony, statement or deposition shall be taken—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/41/eng@> .
